WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,900
Sister Jiantong

2
00:00:01,480 --> 00:00:02,960
What do you want to do when you get out of prison?

3
00:00:05,460 --> 00:00:06,660
I want to go to Erhai

4
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:08,660
The water of Erhai

5
00:00:09,020 --> 00:00:10,180
Clean side

6
00:00:11,220 --> 00:00:12,820
The water birds there are so cute

7
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:15,680
I want to work hard to make money

8
00:00:15,960 --> 00:00:18,220
Go there and open a small B&B

9
00:00:18,420 --> 00:00:19,620
Not to make a lot of money

10
00:00:20,190 --> 00:00:23,030
As long as life is warm enough, Sister Jian Tong

11
00:00:24,020 --> 00:00:25,460
Actually I have never been to Erhai

12
00:00:25,820 --> 00:00:27,060
The charm of those children

13
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:30,340
I know it all from what I saw on TV and newspapers

14
00:00:30,700 --> 00:00:31,820
Even if you are released from prison

15
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:33,460
I don’t have the money to open a B&B either

16
00:00:33,940 --> 00:00:34,900
I just want

17
00:00:35,060 --> 00:00:36,330
before death

18
00:00:36,610 --> 00:00:38,250
So doing the impossible

19
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:46,610
The one who saved his life is in prison.

20
00:00:46,610 --> 00:00:48,930
The only girl who protects me is because of me

21
00:00:48,930 --> 00:00:50,130
Died in that place

22
00:00:50,510 --> 00:00:52,430
The debt I owe is not for you

23
00:00:52,700 --> 00:00:53,620
It's Alu

24
00:00:53,620 --> 00:00:54,700
I can't die yet

25
00:00:54,700 --> 00:00:57,530
I still owe Alu a son, Mr. Haichen

26
00:00:57,960 --> 00:00:59,240
As long as you don't let me drink

27
00:00:59,520 --> 00:01:00,480
No matter what
